    "html": "<tr style=\"height: 89px\"><th id=\"1662574278R226\" style=\"height: 89px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 89px\">227</div></th><td class=\"s70\">Thresh</td><td class=\"s26\"><div style=\"width:70px;height:89px;\"><img src=\"https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaeTNk6JIL7oWJoZg5pMs2432vcOxo1PTb6DFVD-zePUMoPk7EBAZ8vWFkeomkMaUno4PDtLNwQnY0S6EhPwwqZGifhMzu9UFrYf6RyTVe8CEmHLPLMgUZarzJvOemvxi_17daqREI1grKsKY01B2Zrvur6yA3QqoAA=w70-h89\" style=\"width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;\"/></div></td><td class=\"s16\" colspan=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">On </span><span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Weapon Kill:<br></span>Grants an additional <span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">1% ↑1.33% Super Ability Energy.</span><span style=\"color:#f1c232;\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#93c47d;\"> Fusion Rifles, Glaives, Shotguns, and Sniper Rifles grant </span>an additional <span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">1.5% ↑2% Super Ability Energy.</span></td></tr>"
